### Get Categories
GET http://localhost:5000/api/knowledge-base/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get All Published Articles
GET http://localhost:5000/api/knowledge-base?search=wifi
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create Knowledge Article (Admin / Manager)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/knowledge-base
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Resolving Corporate Wi-Fi Authentication Errors",
    "content": "Step 1: Disconnect from Corp-Guest\nStep 2: Install latest 802.1x security certificate\nStep 3: Connect to Corp-Secure using corporate credentials.",
    "category": "Network",
    "tags": ["wifi", "network", "certificate"],
    "status": "Published"
}

### Get Article By ID
GET http://localhost:5000/api/knowledge-base/{{articleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
